{"4360180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Push The Cart Together", "steam_appid": 4360180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHORT DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push the Cart TOGETHER</strong> is a fast-paced, precision-focused cooperative game for two players. Push a massive cart filled with cargo and synchronize your decisions to navigate narrow paths and dangerous obstacles. Coordination and teamwork are essential — one mistake is enough to set everything on fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple themed levels, but the goal is always the same: push the cart to the finish at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play solo or as a duo. In co-op mode, each player controls one side of the cart — pushing or pulling it. You’ll quickly realize that the hardest challenges aren’t the obstacles or the physics… but driving straight and communicating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360180/extras/b34068521b9fe63e81348625d95316fb.avif?t=1778859403\" width=960 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High difficulty</strong> — it will be very, very hard. The world will do everything it can to stop you from reaching the goal. And the environment isn’t the only thing in your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death counter</strong> — you will fall, explode, or completely destroy the cargo many times along the way. Don’t worry — checkpoints help a little.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic physics</strong> — physics rules the world, and all you can do is adapt to it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op gameplay</strong> — transport the cargo alone, play locally with a friend, or connect online in cooperative mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple levels</strong> — diverse stages with unique themes, new challenges, and mechanics that gradually expand your possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timer mode</strong> — mastered the route? Try to reach the finish as fast as possible and beat your best time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden content</strong> — unlock new levels, character skins, and secret challenges. There’s plenty to discover — if you manage to find it all.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push the Cart TOGETHER</strong> is a game about cooperation, precision, and chaos. Reaching the finish requires perfect synchronization, patience, and many attempts. Failure is inevitable — but each one brings you closer to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360180/extras/8773c5d5f4fc6ce64ad52732abb91286.avif?t=1778859403\" width=960 height=270 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHORT DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push the Cart TOGETHER</strong> is a fast-paced, precision-focused cooperative game for two players. Push a massive cart filled with cargo and synchronize your decisions to navigate narrow paths and dangerous obstacles. Coordination and teamwork are essential — one mistake is enough to set everything on fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple themed levels, but the goal is always the same: push the cart to the finish at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play solo or as a duo. In co-op mode, each player controls one side of the cart — pushing or pulling it. You’ll quickly realize that the hardest challenges aren’t the obstacles or the physics… but driving straight and communicating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360180/extras/b34068521b9fe63e81348625d95316fb.avif?t=1778859403\" width=960 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High difficulty</strong> — it will be very, very hard. The world will do everything it can to stop you from reaching the goal. And the environment isn’t the only thing in your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death counter</strong> — you will fall, explode, or completely destroy the cargo many times along the way. Don’t worry — checkpoints help a little.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic physics</strong> — physics rules the world, and all you can do is adapt to it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op gameplay</strong> — transport the cargo alone, play locally with a friend, or connect online in cooperative mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple levels</strong> — diverse stages with unique themes, new challenges, and mechanics that gradually expand your possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timer mode</strong> — mastered the route? Try to reach the finish as fast as possible and beat your best time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden content</strong> — unlock new levels, character skins, and secret challenges. There’s plenty to discover — if you manage to find it all.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push the Cart TOGETHER</strong> is a game about cooperation, precision, and chaos. Reaching the finish requires perfect synchronization, patience, and many attempts. Failure is inevitable — but each one brings you closer to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360180/extras/8773c5d5f4fc6ce64ad52732abb91286.avif?t=1778859403\" width=960 height=270 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Cargo loaded, cart ready, the customer is waiting. Alone or with a friend, push the load to the finish line. Physics and the world around you won’t be friendly. The cargo will explode many times — so will you. It’ll be very hard, but don’t worry… eventually you’ll make it. Right?", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Czech, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Ukrainian, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Portuguese - Brazil, Romanian, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese, Hungarian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360180/61b4fd6c013012593c05a9025de0dde6d8efc3ff/header.jpg?t=1778859403", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360180/cb8618aacc15381cb5c6749dec12bd8cc016861d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778859403", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360180/cb8618aacc15381cb5c6749dec12bd8cc016861d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778859403", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3220 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 2GB / AMD Radeon RX 550<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Friend to play with</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400 / AMD Ryzen 5 5600H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8